   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened Social Cohesion-UNDP-IRQ-00133641</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened social cohesion through, community-based reintegration of at risk-groups in targeted project locations United Nations Development Programme (UNDP) Iraq.The Iraq Crisis Response and Resilience Programme (ICRRP) was designed in 2014 to enable UNDP Iraq to provide immediate support in response to the crisis-situation following the Islamic State of Iraq and the Levant (ISIL), taking control of several locations of the country. ICRRP was originally designed to work under 5 thematic areas</narrative>
  </description>
